      "text": "This concept contrasts the pathology and clinical recognition of multiple system atrophy, progressive supranuclear palsy and corticobasal degeneration. The cited sources distinguish glial alpha-synuclein accumulation in MSA from tau pathology in PSP and CBD. Consensus criteria organize clinical features, while clinicopathological validation highlights the limits of equating corticobasal syndrome with CBD pathology.",
