      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:2c5b86af5522c8ac2f148412d8f48dfacb960ccbd41d82617f0fa89857b1db3b",
      "text": "Lewy body dementia includes dementia with Lewy bodies and Parkinson\u2019s disease dementia. Diagnostic sources distinguish these presentations by the timing of dementia relative to parkinsonism, while qualifying the timing boundary as operational and based on expert opinion. The evidence covers cognitive profiles, clinical criteria, pathological heterogeneity, diagnostic limitations, symptomatic treatment evidence and antipsychotic sensitivity. This is an educational research reference.",
